    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":", ",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Have you ever felt like no one understand what you loved?",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Demandin' a hug, can't reach you when you standin' above",
          "rhyme":"Ov",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I got dreams which I need to accomplish, I promise",
          "rhyme":"iz",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"I'm honest, clean my conscience, see the nonsense",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Good days are gone, they used to be here",
          "rhyme":"eR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Life is but a dream, doesn't seem to be clear",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Been meanin' to write my thoughts down, jot down my mind",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Take the words I can't say and put 'em into rhymes",
          "rhyme":"im",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"So I'm up all night on this beat-up mic",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Convincin' myself that I can't cheat on life (I let a good girl go)",
          "rhyme":"ajf",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"So, papa, don't preach, and mama, don't worry",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Nothing's gonna hurt me, growin' up in a hurry (I let a good girl go)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"I'm still learnin', waitin' for your teachin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"In this game of life that I seem to be beatin'",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"What the right thing to do isn't always understood",
          "rhyme":"ud",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"And some evil in the world is hidin' under good",
          "rhyme":"ud",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"Life ain't easy, don't put it past the name",
          "rhyme":"am",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"Runnin' into coins, start with sacks of change",
          "rhyme":"#Z",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"Tryna save up money for the microphone",
          "rhyme":"On",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"And while everybody's out, I just write at home",
          "rhyme":"om",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"'Cause to achieve, you need to leave things behind",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"Wear the rhyme book out 'til you can see the spine (I let a good girl go)",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"Read between the lines, more than appears to be",
          "rhyme":"ab",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"Wonder who I'm here to be, so I clearly speak (I let a good girl go)",
          "rhyme":"Ek",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"24",
          "text":"Sit back with my feet up on the chair",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"25",
          "text":"I relax 'cause when the world's gone, rap will be there",
          "rhyme":"eR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"26",
          "text":"Don't have to be scared, just sit back and chill",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"27",
          "text":"I attack these wack cats with the rappin' ill",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"28",
          "text":"Pass the Phil' 'cause I'm tryna get faded",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"29",
          "text":"It's sacred passin' round the blunt, it's the greatest",
          "rhyme":"Est",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"30",
          "text":"I wasted payments just to get the tree",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"31",
          "text":"Now I'ma stop talkin', so y'all can check the beat",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
